{"id":"en_road-trip-2000","title":"Road Trip (2000)","titleEn":"Road Trip (2000)","description":"Four college friends set out on a road trip after an incriminating tape is accidentally sent to a female friend, and they need to get it back before any damage is done. The journey becomes the driving force of the story as the group travels together with that urgent errand hanging over them. Road Trip (2000) follows this premise of a trip sparked by a mailing mistake and the friends' attempt to recover the tape. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://img.nartodrama-api.online/poster/257629.jpg","backdrop":"https://img.nartodrama-api.online/poster/257629.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","الانتقام","توتر رومانسي","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7de4ac/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_road-trip-2000_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7de4ac/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_road-trip-2000_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7de4ac/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_road-trip-2000_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7de4ac/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_road-trip-2000_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7de4ac/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_road-trip-2000_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Fre